Dear Rustlers,

The final release date is August 31 and due to that, we would like to share the pre-release update with you NOW!

What you will see in this pre-release update:

 New sub-quests! Witch and Rapper storylines!
 Buyable safehouse;
 Added enemy knight on a horse with a lance (which can be seen when a player reaches 5 stars);
 Animals;
 Updated quest dialogues;
 Bug fixes;


1.0 update is waiting for you on the beta branch.

If you don't know how to activate the beta, you can find the instruction below.:
Follow the red mark :D
